nalità diventa evidente fin dal primo momento."},{"language":"en-US","title":"My Fault","overview":"Noah must leave her city, boyfriend, and friends to move into William Leister's mansion, the flashy and wealthy husband of her mother Rafaela. As a proud and independent 17 year old, Noah resists living in a mansion surrounded by luxury. However, it is there where she meets Nick, her new stepbrother, and the clash of their strong personalities becomes evident from the very beginning.","tagline":"Love can only survive in the shadow of secrets."},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"Noah debe dejar su ciudad, novio y amigos para mudarse a la mansión de William Leister, el flamante y rico marido de su madre Rafaela. Por otro lado, con 17 años, orgullosa e independiente, Noah se resiste a vivir en una mansión rodeada de lujo. Allí conoce a Nick, su nuevo hermanastro, y el choque de sus fuertes personalidades se hace evidente desde el primer momento.","tagline":"El amor sólo puede sobrevivir a la sombra de los secretos."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wXwB3KhYhvzfsDMH6JBgbfsLi8s.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oz4U9eA6ilYf1tyiVuGmkftdLac.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1010581,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wXwB3KhYhvzfsDMH6JBgbfsLi8s.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wXwB3KhYhvzfsDMH6JBgbfsLi8s.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wXwB3KhYhvzfsDMH6JBgbfsLi8s.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wXwB3KhYhvzfsDMH6JBgbfsLi8s.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/irqxqDQrlIQby4JLURB692ho94I.jpg","previewUrl":"https://